  "definition": "Landfill Closure and Post-Closure Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-12-21",
  "historyNote": "#5172, eff 7-1-91; amd by #5297, eff 12-24-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 800); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2507.03); ss by #10597, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14156, eff 12-21-24",
